116:4\" href=\"/Psalms.116.4\">ψ 116:4</a>; f. <span dir=\"rtl\">מַלְּטִי</span> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 1:12\" href=\"/I_Kings.1.12\">1 K 1:12</a>; + 4 times Imv.; Inf. abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">מַלֵּט</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 46:2\" href=\"/Isaiah.46.2\">Is 46:2</a> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 39:18\" href=\"/Jeremiah.39.18\">Je 39:18</a>; Pt. <span dir=\"rtl\">מְמַלֵּט</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 19:11\" href=\"/I_Samuel.19.11\">1 S 19:11</a>; pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">מְמַלְּטִים</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 19:6\" href=\"/II_Samuel.19.6\">2 S 19:6</a>;— <strong>1.</strong>  <em>lay</em> (eggs; i.e. let them slip out; of arrow-snake) <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 34:15\" href=\"/Isaiah.34.15\">Is 34:15</a> <strong>2.</strong>  <em>let escape:</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">וימלטו עצמתיו</span> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 23:18\" href=\"/II_Kings.23.18\">2 K 23:18</a> <em>and so they let his bones</em> (the prophet’s) <em>escape</em> (from the burning). <strong>3.</strong>  <em>deliver</em>, abs. <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 46:4\" href=\"/Isaiah.46.4\">Is 46:4</a>; c. acc. <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 46:2\" href=\"/Isaiah.46.2\">Is 46:2</a> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 39:18\" href=\"/Jeremiah.39.18\">Je 39:18</a><sup>(×2)</sup> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 41:2\" href=\"/Psalms.41.2\">ψ 41:2</a> <a data-ref=\"Job 22:30\" href=\"/Job.22.30\">Jb 22:30</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 29:12\" href=\"/Job.29.12\">29:12</a> <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 8:8\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.8.8\">Ec 8:8</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 9:15\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.9.15\">9:15</a>; c. <span dir=\"rtl\">מִיַּד</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 6:23\" href=\"/Job.6.23\">Jb 6:23</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">מִכַּף</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 19:10\" href=\"/II_Samuel.19.10\">2 S 19:10</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">מִשְּׁחִיתוֹתָם</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 107:20\" href=\"/Psalms.107.20\">ψ 107:20</a>; elsewhere <span dir=\"rtl\">מִלֵּט נֶפֶשׁ</span> <em>deliver, save, life</em> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 19:11\" href=\"/I_Samuel.19.11\">1 S 19:11</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 19:6\" href=\"/II_Samuel.19.6\">2 S 19:6</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Kings 1:12\" href=\"/I_Kings.1.12\">1 K 1:12</a> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 48:6\" href=\"/Jeremiah.48.6\">Je 48:6</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 51:6\" href=\"/Jeremiah.51.6\">51:6</a>, <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 51:45\" href=\"/Jeremiah.51.45\">45</a> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 33:5\" href=\"/Ezekiel.33.5\">Ez 33:5</a> <a data-ref=\"Amos 2:14\" href=\"/Amos.2.14\">Am 2:14</a>, <a data-ref=\"Amos 2:15\" href=\"/Amos.2.15\">15</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 89:49\" href=\"/Psalms.89.49\">ψ 89:49</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 116:4\" href=\"/Psalms.116.4\">116:4</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">נפשׁ</span> om. <a data-ref=\"Amos 2:15\" href=\"/Amos.2.15\">Am 2:15</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 33:17\" href=\"/Psalms.33.17\">ψ 33:17</a> <a data-ref=\"Job 20:20\" href=\"/Job.20.20\">Jb 20:20</a>.—(This form not in Hex, Ju., Ch., <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 1\" href=\"/Isaiah.1\">Is. 1</a>)<br><strong>Hiph.</strong>  Pf. 3 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">הִמְלִיט</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 31:5\" href=\"/Isaiah.31.5\">Is 31:5</a>; 3 fs. <span dir=\"rtl\">הִמְ֫לִיטָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 66:7\" href=\"/Isaiah.66.7\">Is 66:7</a>. <strong>1.</strong>  <em>give birth to</em> a male child <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 66:7\" href=\"/Isaiah.66.7\">Is 66:7</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">יָֽלְדָה</span>, cf. <strong>Pi. 1</strong>). <strong>2.</strong>  <em>deliver:</em> abs. <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 31:5\" href=\"/Isaiah.31.5\">Is 31:5</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">הִצִּיל גָּנַן</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">פָּסַח</span>).<br><strong>Hithp.</strong>  Impf. 1 s. <span dir=\"rtl\">וָאֶתְמַלְּטָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 19:20\" href=\"/Job.19.20\">Jb 19:20</a>; 3 mpl. <span dir=\"rtl\">יִתְמַלְּטוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 41:11\" href=\"/Job.41.11\">Jb 41:11</a>. <strong>1.</strong>  <em>slip forth, escape</em> (sparks of fire from jaws of crocodile; RV <em>leap forth</em>) <a data-ref=\"Job 41:11\" href=\"/Job.41.11\">Jb 41:11</a>. <strong>2.</strong>  <em>escape</em> (with the skin of the teeth, the gums; only these left unattacked by leprosy) <a data-ref=\"Job 19:20\" href=\"/Job.19.20\">Jb 19:20</a>.","next":"BDB, מֶ֫לֶט","prev":"BDB, מִלְחָמָה²"}